We are seeking a motivated Materials Planning Intern to join our Supply Chain organization. In this role, you will have the opportunity to apply your analytical and problem-solving skills to real-world materials planning challenges that directly support the timely production and delivery of Shield AI systems. You will work alongside experienced supply chain professionals, gain hands-on exposure to planning processes and cross-functional operations, and contribute to initiatives that improve ERP signals the rest of the business uses to operate.
&gt;
&gt;
Required qualifications:
