&gt;
As a Fraud Operations Intern, you&#x27;ll join our Shopper Risk Operations team, the people who keep Sezzle safe for shoppers and merchants. You&#x27;ll review activity flagged by our fraud detection systems and Customer Support, decide what&#x27;s fraud and what isn&#x27;t, and help us spot new fraud patterns before they spread. You&#x27;ll work alongside analysts, data scientists, and engineers, and see how fraud prevention works inside a fast-growing, publicly traded fintech.
&gt;
We are seeking a talented and motivated intern who is best in class with a high IQ plus a high EQ. No prior fraud experience is required; we&#x27;ll train you. Curiosity, attention to detail, and good judgment matter more.
&gt;
This is a paid, full-time, remote internship: Monday to Friday, 12:00 pm to 21:00 pm local time.
&gt;
What You&#x27;ll Do
&gt;
Review transactions and accounts flagged for possible fraud or abuse
&gt;
Investigate cases using our internal tools and policies, and decide whether to block or clear them
&gt;
Look for patterns in account and transaction data
&gt;
Share what you find to help improve our fraud rules and detection models
&gt;
